5,15,15,1Style: Karaoke-furigana,Duality,52.5,&H009E375F,&H009E375F,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.25,0,8,15,15,15,1Style: Karaoke,Duality,82,&H009E375F,&H009E375F,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.5,0,8,15,15,15,1Style: Translation,Duality,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.5,0,2,15,15,15,1Style: Sign-OP,Captain Redemption,375,&H0015181B,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,0,0,2,15,15,15,1Style: Sign-Wano,KG Ten Thousand Reasons Alt,60,&H005B57D2,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,0,0,2,15,15,15,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.99,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalışmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:41.87,0:01:51.86,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalışmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:57.42,0:02:03.01,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Grand Line'ın Kuraigana Adası'ndaki Shikkearu Krallığı kalıntılarındayız.Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.06,0:02:10.31,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Yerle bir olmuş ülkenin göleti yakınındaki tarihi kalede...Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.35,0:02:12.77,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,malum kişi hâlâ ikamet etmekteydi.Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.65,0:02:19.49,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Shichibukai...Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.49,0:02:21.70,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,ve dünyanın en güçlü kılıç ustası...Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.70,0:02:25.41,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,olduğunu söylenen Dracule Mihawk.Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.50,0:02:37.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moria-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.51,0:02:47.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayattaymış...Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.31,0:02:53.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Gecko Moria ve zombi ordusu bir baskın düzenledi."Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.02,0:02:55.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayatta!Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.03,0:02:59.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moria-sama hayatta! Moria-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.24,0:03:05.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baksana! Şükürler olsun ki Moria-sama hayatta!Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.45,0:03:09.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, bu sabah okudum.Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.91,0:03:14.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyleyse ne diye söylemedin şapşal?! Benim için çok önemli!Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.50,0:03:15.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Umrumda değil.Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.46,0:03:18.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olmalı ama! Benim kaptanım!Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.88,0:03:22.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İki yıl evvel, Zirve Savaşı'nda öldüğünü sanmıştım!Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.76,0:03:24.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İçime su serpildi!Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.80,0:03:31.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moria-sama hayattaysa Absalom ile Hogback de yanında olabilir!Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.56,0:03:36.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu görmek istiyorum, hemen yola çıkıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.28,0:03:46.03,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Sahi...Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.78,0:03:49.91,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Uzun süre boyunca beni ağırladı.Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.25,0:03:56.67,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Thriller Bark'ta Hasır Şapkalar'la savaşırken...Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.67,0:03:59.59,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,ansızın Bartholomew Kuma tarafından buraya postalanmıştım.Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.05,0:04:02.13,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,İki yıl su gibi geçti.Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.34,0:04:08.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moria inatçı keçinin teki, tıpkı kontrol ettiği zombiler gibi.Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.76,0:04:11.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha? Moria-sama hakkında ileri geri mi konuştun?Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.31,0:04:12.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nankör pislik!Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.06,0:04:15.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ona borçlu değilim.Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.27,0:04:17.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana borçlusun ama!Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.56,0:04:20.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin için kaç kere yemek pişirdiğimden haberin var mı?Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.36,0:04:23.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senden fazla yemek pişirdim.Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.40,0:04:25.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tarlayı ekip biçmene yardım ettim!Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.32,0:04:28.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de evimi açtım.Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.08,0:04:32.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tam bir gıcıksın ya!Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.08,0:04:33.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyle olsun!Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.92,0:04:42.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.34,0:04:44.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keyfin bilir.Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.18,0:04:48.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Duygusala bağlamadığımıza sevindim.Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.10,0:04:52.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendine dikkat et.Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.20,0:05:06.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çok naziksin!Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.61,0:05:10.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yere batasıca! Durup dururken nezaket göstermesene!Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.25,0:05:22.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaptığın her şey için teşekkür ederim!Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.38,0:05:26.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amma yaygaracı bir kadınsın.Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.93,0:05:27.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fakat...Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.30,0:05:33.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,şu an adadan ayrılmak isabetli bir karar olabilir.Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.31,0:05:34.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.81,0:05:40.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hâlâ Mary Geoise'da sürmekte olan Reverie'de...Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.61,0:05:44.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ilginç bir konu gündeme getirildi.Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.84,0:06:12.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İlerleyin!Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.83,0:06:38.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Absalom'u...Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.75,0:06:42.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,nerede tutuyorsunuz?Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.81,0:07:06.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden ölmüyorlar ki?Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.16,0:07:15.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Absalom nerede tutuluyor?Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.03,0:07:16.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bilmiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.95,0:07:20.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayaktakımındakilerin bir bok bildiği yok!Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.67,0:07:24.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Karasakal...Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.33,0:07:28.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Teach nerede? Getirin karşıma!Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.17,0:07:30.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne cüretle bizi küçümsersin!Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.30,0:07:33.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sağır mısınız?Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.01,0:07:36.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Teach'i getirin dedim!Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.51,0:07:40.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Teach! Neredesin?Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.85,0:07:43.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kafa bırakmadılar-miyav.Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.40,0:07:47.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gecko Moria geldi, Pizarro-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.40,0:07:50.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir zamanların Shichibukai'si!Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.69,0:07:53.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi ya, niye adaya aldınız ki?Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.95,0:07:57.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Z-Zombi ordusuyla zorla girdi efendim!Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.91,0:07:59.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Limandan geriye eser kalmadı!Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.29,0:08:02.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Derdi neymiş?Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.38,0:08:09.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Filo kaptanı Teach'i görmek istiyor!Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.46,0:08:14.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geçen gün adaya gelen Absalom adındaki görünmez adamı arıyormuş anlaşılan.Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.60,0:08:18.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi hatırladım!Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.01,0:08:21.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ortaya çıkmazsan...Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.06,0:08:24.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kaleye zorla girerim!Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.73,0:08:26.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moria-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.40,0:08:31.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buradayım!Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.44,0:08:34.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen misin, Absalom?Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.53,0:08:38.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Patron, benim ya!Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.08,0:08:41.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şükürler olsun, hayattasın demek!Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.45,0:08:45.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gördüğün üzere turp gibiyim!Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.25,0:08:50.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yollarımızı ayırdıktan sonra senden hiç haber alamadığımızdan...Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.67,0:08:53.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,merak ettik!Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.88,0:08:58.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kusura bakma patron ya! Bu ada bildiğin cennet!Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.35,0:09:03.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendimi öyle kaptırmışım ki iletişime geçmeyi unutup gitti!Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.44,0:09:10.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sebebi buysa ne âlâ!Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.86,0:09:12.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fakat...Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.57,0:09:15.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bu elemanları da boş yere harcadık.Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.41,0:09:19.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zombiler, siz de durabilirsiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.32,0:09:20.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemiye dönün!Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.08,0:09:31.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Karasakal Korsanları yetenek kullanıcılarını avlamaları ile bilinirler!Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.01,0:09:34.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet.Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.42,0:09:41.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Görünmez olmanı sağladığı için senin şu yeteneğin...Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.72,0:09:46.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,oldukça cezbedici.Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.56,0:09:49.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biliyorum ya...Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.73,0:09:51.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hem de bal gibi...Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.99,0:09:56.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.53,0:10:05.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acıdı! Sıçayım!Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.41,0:10:06.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimsin sen?Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.46,0:10:09.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neredesin?Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.14,0:10:25.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kim olduğumu biliyor musun?Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.02,0:10:29.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yağmur Shiryu!Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.60,0:10:34.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Döneklik edip Teach'e katılan eski Impel Down iti!Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.57,0:10:37.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yanlış sayılmaz.Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.24,0:10:48.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ee, yeteneğimi beğendin mi?Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.54,0:10:53.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Görünmez oldun!Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.55,0:11:00.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O Absalom'un yeteneğiydi.Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.05,0:11:06.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoksa...Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.77,0:11:11.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boktan önsezin doğru, Gecko Moria.Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.19,0:11:14.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Epey işe yarar bir yetenek edindim.Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.65,0:11:18.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hay içine...Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.90,0:11:23.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sıçayım!Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.29,0:11:31.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyleyse, sen kimin nesisin lan?Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.18,0:11:46.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Devon!Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.32,0:12:03.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Devon-sama! – Devon-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.95,0:12:09.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adiler, yoksa Absalom...Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.37,0:12:15.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buraya öyle dikkatsizce gelmemeliydi!Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.00,0:12:18.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cesedi duruyor ama götürmek ister misin?Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.50,0:12:22.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ceset fetişin var, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.60,0:12:32.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alçaklar! Bunu ödeyeceksiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.35,0:12:36.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne cüretle yoldaşımı öldürürsünüz?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.61,0:12:41.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepinizi cesede çevireceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.74,0:12:45.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sıkıysa yap da görelim.Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.01,0:13:14.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsan Adası'nın töresini çiğneme.Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.14,0:13:16.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ses..!Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.06,0:13:19.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siktir lan! Ortaya çık!Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.07,0:13:22.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayatta olmaz.Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.48,0:13:25.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu an keyif çatıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.32,0:13:29.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ada, korsanlar için bir cennettir.Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.58,0:13:33.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tadını çıkarmazsak olmaz!Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.12,0:13:35.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Millet!Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.25,0:13:38.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Parti yapmayı sever misiniz?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.13,0:13:48.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyleyse...Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.05,0:13:51.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,gemime gelin!Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.69,0:14:06.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moria!Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.20,0:14:09.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen de sever misin...Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.95,0:14:12.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,parti yapmayı?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.60,0:14:33.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bugünün gazetesini okudun mu?Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.52,0:14:38.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çok eğlenceliydi!Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.31,0:14:42.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Reverie'nin dördüncü gününde...Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.27,0:14:44.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Devrim Ordusu'nun sıçtığımın komutanları...Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.98,0:14:49.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,nihayet Kuma'yı kurtarmak için Kutsal Toprak Mary Geoise'a girip...Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.86,0:14:56.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Donanma Amiralleri Ryokugyu ve Fujitora ile çarpıştılar!Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.50,0:15:00.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu sırada...Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.42,0:15:05.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,canavar Kaido'nun kaldığı Wano'da...Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.17,0:15:08.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hâlihazırda dillere pelesenk Hasır Şapka'yla...Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.63,0:15:12.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kanı kaynayan birkaç serseri toplanmış!Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.89,0:15:15.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peşlerinde ise...Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.31,0:15:20.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,küplere binmiş Yonko, Big Mom var!Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.90,0:15:26.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne olacak dersin?Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.16,0:15:36.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çoktan başladı!Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.24,0:15:38.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kral unvanı yolunda...Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.79,0:15:43.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,en güçlülerin amansız çarpışması!Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.35,0:18:08.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dük Inuarashi'yle kafa kafaya dövüşüyor.Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.56,0:18:12.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dükümüzü zorluyor. Etkileyici.Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.44,0:18:15.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden Ashura?Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.41,0:18:21.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden bu muazzam kudretini Oden efendimizin çok sevdiği Kuri halkı için sarf etmiyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.63,0:18:33.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öldü gitti o!Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.21,0:18:37.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Asıl siz bunca yıldan sonra ne bok yemeye geldiniz buraya?Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.42,0:18:40.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama'nın hayalini gerçekleştirmek için!Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.72,0:18:45.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama'nın başına ne geldiğini unutmuş...Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.35,0:18:48.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kılıcını keyfine göre savurup duruyorsun!Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.06,0:18:49.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kes ulan!Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.44,0:19:02.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir halt bildiğin var sanki!Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.91,0:19:05.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Diyeceğin bir şey varsa söyle!Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.25,0:19:14.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tilki Ateşi Stili: Söğüt Alevi Parıltısı!Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.60,0:19:25.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beyler...Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.77,0:19:29.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bu kadar yeter.Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.06,0:19:32.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Inuarashi!Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.81,0:19:33.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ashura!Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.36,0:19:45.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni düş kırıklığına uğrattınız, Ashura-san!Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.74,0:19:49.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiku!Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.62,0:19:55.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,20 yıl önce, Oden-sama'yı kaybettiğimizden beri Wano'ya ben sahip çıktım.Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.50,0:20:00.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi gelmiş ahkam kesiyorsunuz.Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.42,0:20:01.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinlemeyeceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.97,0:20:09.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yatın kalkın da sizi soymadan gittiğime şükredin.Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.52,0:20:12.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unuttunuz mu?Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.44,0:20:15.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hep böyleydik biz!Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.56,0:20:21.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Oden denen o adama büyük saygı duyup...Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.32,0:20:26.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,samurayı olarak hayatımı ona adadım!Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.12,0:20:30.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Hanesi'nin uşağı olmadım ama hiç!Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.21,0:20:34.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.38,0:20:37.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke?Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.76,0:20:53.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen de benim nasıl biri olduğumu unutma.Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.06,0:20:57.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yılmak nedir bilmem.Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.06,0:20:59.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni tarafımıza çekeceğim.Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.73,0:21:08.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Hanesi'nin samurayları döndü diye herkesin havaya uçacağı yok.Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.87,0:21:17.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz ülkeye 20 yıl sırtınızı döndünüz!Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.75,0:21:20.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O kaybolan yıllar geri gelmeyecek!Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.72,0:21:32.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir şeyiniz var mı?Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.52,0:21:33.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır.Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.48,0:21:35.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidelim.Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.06,0:21:40.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rahatsız ediyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.02,0:21:41.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Raizo-san!Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.02,0:21:44.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-dono'nun yerini saptadım.Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.53,0:21:47.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Udon'daki tutsak kampında.Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.70,0:21:52.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tahmin ettiğim gibi. Bu işi sana emanet edebilir miyim?Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.20,0:21:53.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlaşıldı!Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.88,0:22:03.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otama, uyandın mı?Dialogue: 50,0:22:05.51,0:22:09.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usta, n'oldu bana?Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.80,0:22:15.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'nun saldırısına maruz kaldın, bu kişiler de seninle ilgilendi.Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.56,0:22:19.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyle mi?Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.60,0:22:21.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Teşekkürler!Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.56,0:22:23.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Minnettarım!Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.19,0:22:26.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neyse ki yaraların hafif, kısa sürede toparlarsın.Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.69,0:22:28.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Teşekkürler!Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.16,0:22:36.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korkudan bayılmışım.Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.50,0:22:41.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saldırıya uğradığımı bile hatırlamıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:22:42.42,0:22:46.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendini paralayan Kısrak-chan'ı anımsar gibiyim.Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.72,0:22:50.93,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Nereye, efendim?Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.02,0:22:59.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Düşmanı uşağın mı yaptın?Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.94,0:23:01.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Harika bir yetenek.Dialogue: 50,0:23:01.60,0:23:05.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kısrak-chan'la ağabey nerede? İyiler mi?Dialogue: 50,0:23:06.03,0:23:09.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kısrak ne durumda bilmiyoruz.Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.32,0:23:11.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy'yse...Dialogue: 50,0:23:19.91,0:23:20.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:21.37,0:23:24.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ağabey ağır yaralı hâlde...Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.42,0:23:26.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Udon'daki kampa mı götürüldü?Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.42,0:23:28.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durum kötü!Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.80,0:23:30.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hop, yaraların açılacak.Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.51,0:23:34.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaralarımdan çok, Luffy ağabeyin durumunu merak ediyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.89,0:23:39.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir şey olmaz. Luffy bizim kaptanımız!Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.10,0:23:44.61,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Udon, Wano'daki bir bölgedir.Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.61,0:23:50.24,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Gel gör ki günümüzde tutsak kampı maksadıyla kullanılmakta.Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.53,0:23:55.70,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Ağır suçluların ölesiye çalıştırıldığı...Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.70,0:23:59.36,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,gidenin dönmediği...Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.36,0:24:01.29,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,uğursuz bir mekan.Dialogue: 50,0:24:16.89,0:24:19.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geyşa istemez.Dialogue: 50,0:24:19.31,0:24:22.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimse bu odaya yaklaşmasın.Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.31,0:24:23.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Emredersiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.67,0:24:48.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Az çakal değilsin!Dialogue: 50,0:24:54.51,0:24:58.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Silah ve mühimmat siparişleri bu.Dialogue: 50,0:24:58.93,0:25:01.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Az çakal değilsin!Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.98,0:25:04.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyle mi diyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.98,0:25:09.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vay, amma da çokmuş! Savaş falan mı çıkacak?Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.69,0:25:12.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ülke dışında ne oluyor, ne bilelim?Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.28,0:25:15.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İstediklerini yapıp geçelim.Dialogue: 50,0:25:15.24,0:25:18.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Az çakal değilsin!Dialogue: 50,0:25:20.16,0:25:21.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyle mi diyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.41,0:25:25.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dikkatle izle Onami. Yaşım gözlerime de vurdu zira.Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.54,0:25:28.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorun olmayacak. Sakince izle sadece.Dialogue: 50,0:25:29.75,0:25:31.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kafası, görüşümü kapatıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.84,0:25:35.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kim var orada?Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.72,0:25:36.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimsin sen?Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.44,0:25:48.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kim bunlar?Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.40,0:25:53.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tavan arasına da bakın!Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.99,0:25:56.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Muhakkak yakalayın onları!Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.91,0:26:00.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sakinleş, Shinobu-chan!Dialogue: 50,0:26:00.28,0:26:01.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçamazsınız!Dialogue: 50,0:26:10.25,0:26:11.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sessiz ol.Dialogue: 50,0:26:12.75,0:26:14.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nereye kayboldular?Dialogue: 50,0:26:19.97,0:26:22.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kedi miymiş be?Dialogue: 50,0:27:02.22,0:27:03.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nereye kayboldular?Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.90,0:27:17.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neyin var, Shinobu-chan?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:22.70,0:27:23.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi misin?Dialogue: 50,0:27:27.04,0:27:28.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onami...Dialogue: 50,0:27:28.70,0:27:30.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sana bir şey söyleyeceğim.Dialogue: 50,0:27:30.79,0:27:31.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 50,0:27:34.29,0:27:37.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bulun onları! Her taşın altına bakın!Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.71,0:27:40.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yabancıları elinizden kaçırmayın!Dialogue: 50,0:27:46.76,0:27:48.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim...Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.85,0:27:52.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sivri cisim fobim var.Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.74,0:28:03.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Savaşamazsın ki böyle!Dialogue: 50,0:28:03.70,0:28:05.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unutma Onami...Dialogue: 50,0:28:08.04,0:28:09.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,olgun kadınlar...Dialogue: 50,0:28:10.50,0:28:12.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,başlı başına bir...Dialogue: 50,0:28:13.21,0:28:14.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,silahtır.Dialogue: 50,0:28:22.26,0:28:24.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rüzgârı arkamıza alalım.Dialogue: 50,0:28:24.84,0:28:25.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 50,0:28:28.63,0:28:30.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ninpo: Dev Planör!Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.61,0:28:46.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shinobu-chan! çok iyisin!Dialogue: 50,0:28:48.41,0:28:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bulamadınız mı lan daha?Dialogue: 50,0:28:54.17,0:28:56.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Konakta ne gördün, Onami?Dialogue: 50,0:28:56.92,0:28:58.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şey...Dialogue: 50,0:28:58.88,0:29:02.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hah! Liman ismini ve nakliye gününü.Dialogue: 50,0:29:02.26,0:29:04.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aferin!Dialogue: 50,0:29:04.05,0:29:06.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık silahların yerini ve zamanını biliyoruz.Dialogue: 50,0:29:07.26,0:29:08.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşe koyulalım.Dialogue: 50,0:29:09.31,0:29:10.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hı-hı!Dialogue: 50,0:29:22.28,0:29:25.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şehirde bir şeyler oluyor bak.Dialogue: 50,0:29:25.91,0:29:27.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neyin kuyruğu bu böyle?Dialogue: 50,0:29:28.07,0:29:29.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İndirim falan mı var?Dialogue: 50,0:29:29.41,0:29:31.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çıtırlarla dolu ortalık.Dialogue: 50,0:29:32.75,0:29:36.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hoş geldiniz, buyurun.Dialogue: 50,0:29:41.88,0:29:45.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tatmadan geçmeyin, hanımlar!Dialogue: 50,0:29:47.22,0:29:49.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ses... Yoksa...Dialogue: 50,0:29:55.56,0:29:58.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyle güzel ki ağızda dağılıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:30:00.19,0:30:02.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tam da al dente kıvamında!Dialogue: 50,0:30:05.44,0:30:06.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sangoro'nun...Dialogue: 50,0:30:07.15,0:30:08.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,nihachi sobası!Dialogue: 50,0:30:11.53,0:30:13.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üç, beş, iki, sekiz!Dialogue: 50,0:30:13.83,0:30:16.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Toplamda on sekiz!Dialogue: 50,0:30:24.21,0:30:26.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşte özel soba'm!Dialogue: 50,0:30:27.34,0:30:29.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Parıldıyorlar bildiğin!Dialogue: 50,0:30:29.13,0:30:30.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çiğnemesi de kolay.Dialogue: 50,0:30:30.59,0:30:33.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Nefis! – Nefis!Dialogue: 50,0:30:33.31,0:30:35.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu mu samuray toplamak?Dialogue: 50,0:30:35.77,0:30:38.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine bekleriz!Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.94,0:30:42.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kara bulutlar geziyor üzerimizde!Dialogue: 50,0:30:42.40,0:30:45.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayaletler çıktı ortaya, esip gürlüyorlar.Dialogue: 50,0:30:45.78,0:30:50.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuzeydeki mezarlıkta hayalet görüldü! Son gelişmeler burada!Dialogue: 50,0:30:51.12,0:30:53.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada neler oluyor?Dialogue: 50,0:30:53.08,0:30:55.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir bakalım.Dialogue: 50,0:30:59.96,0:31:02.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Cellat" Kamazo mu?Dialogue: 50,0:31:17.52,0:31:19.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada!Dialogue: 50,0:31:22.65,0:31:28.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tir tir titreyin! Kendisiyle karşılaştınız mı canınızdan oldunuz demektir.Dialogue: 50,0:31:28.90,0:31:31.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçek kimliği ne?Dialogue: 50,0:31:32.53,0:31:35.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim de kocamı öldürdü, alçak!Dialogue: 50,0:31:35.87,0:31:38.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gelin, gelin!Dialogue: 50,0:31:38.66,0:31:44.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sırada, gece yarıları ortaya çıkan İblis Saati Çocuğu var!Dialogue: 50,0:31:44.08,0:31:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zenginlerden çaldıklarını...Dialogue: 50,0:31:46.30,0:31:50.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,gecekondulardaki fakirlere dağıtan havalı bir hırsız!Dialogue: 50,0:31:50.22,0:31:53.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahraman mı kötü adam mı belli değil!Dialogue: 50,0:31:53.55,0:31:56.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçek kimliği merak konusu!Dialogue: 50,0:31:56.22,0:31:59.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Detaylar için gazetemizi satın alın!Dialogue: 50,0:31:59.27,0:32:01.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! Bay İblis Saati!Dialogue: 50,0:32:01.52,0:32:02.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir tane alayım!Dialogue: 50,0:32:02.90,0:32:04.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tabii, buyurun!Dialogue: 50,0:32:04.02,0:32:05.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Almayan bin pişman!Dialogue: 50,0:32:05.65,0:32:08.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sınırlı sayıda özel baskılarımız da var!Dialogue: 50,0:32:08.61,0:32:10.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir tane de bana!Dialogue: 50,0:32:10.45,0:32:11.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana da!Dialogue: 50,0:32:25.71,0:32:27.46,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Ters hilal.Dialogue: 50,0:32:30.80,0:32:31.88,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Kim verdi?Dialogue: 50,0:33:17.05,0:33:19.51,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Sahiden döndü mü...Dialogue: 50,0:33:28.77,0:33:30.52,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,– Kozuki Hanesi? – Kozuki Hanesi?Dialogue: 50,0:33:40.53,0:33:43.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baksana, hayaletlerin işi değil mi bu?Dialogue: 50,0:33:43.87,0:33:47.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şüphelenmek neye yarar? Yer yerinden oynayacak.Dialogue: 50,0:33:50.42,0:33:51.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidiyorum ben!Dialogue: 50,0:33:53.55,0:33:58.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,10 yıl önce olacaktı, koşa koşa giderdim ben de.Dialogue: 50,0:33:59.14,0:34:02.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O değil de silah mevzusunu nasıl halledeceksiniz?Dialogue: 50,0:34:03.93,0:34:07.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ülkede samuray değilsen meyve bıçağı bile taşıyamazsın.Dialogue: 50,0:34:09.10,0:34:11.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendo okullarının kapısına kilit vuruldu.Dialogue: 50,0:34:11.36,0:34:16.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Karate ve judo gibi dövüş sanatları da yasaklandı.Dialogue: 50,0:34:16.03,0:34:19.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Halihazırda ayaklanmaya çıkacak tüm yolları tıkadı, Orochi.Dialogue: 50,0:34:20.28,0:34:23.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İcap ederse çıplak ellerimle savaşırım!Dialogue: 50,0:34:23.04,0:34:27.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne zamandır beklediğimiz fırsat geldi sonunda!Dialogue: 50,0:34:27.50,0:34:28.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heyecanımı...Dialogue: 50,0:34:29.63,0:34:31.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bastıramıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:35:02.20,0:35:03.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-dono.Dialogue: 50,0:35:03.08,0:35:04.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Raizo!Dialogue: 50,0:35:05.20,0:35:06.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fazla sesli oldu!Dialogue: 50,0:35:08.79,0:35:09.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir sorun mu var?Dialogue: 50,0:35:10.71,0:35:14.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, iyi haberlerim var.Dialogue: 50,0:35:14.84,0:35:16.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otama daha iyi.Dialogue: 50,0:35:17.67,0:35:19.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! Öyle mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:35:28.02,0:35:29.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tekrar geleceğim.Dialogue: 50,0:35:29.60,0:35:30.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam.Dialogue: 50,0:35:31.23,0:35:33.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaşasın!Dialogue: 50,0:35:45.03,0:35:46.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jack...Dialogue: 50,0:35:47.20,0:35:49.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuri'nin bağışları yerlerde.Dialogue: 50,0:35:56.04,0:35:57.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo da gitmişken...Dialogue: 50,0:35:58.34,0:36:02.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,şimdi kimle iş yapacağız biliyorsun, di' mi?Dialogue: 50,0:36:02.59,0:36:04.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kusura bakmayın ağabeylerim.Dialogue: 50,0:36:10.02,0:36:13.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen dingili yetiyor zaten.Dialogue: 50,0:36:14.40,0:36:19.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aynen! Andaval King, yetiyor da artıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:36:24.32,0:36:27.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Kafana girdi mi, maşa Jack? – Kafana girdi mi, maşa Jack?Dialogue: 50,0:36:30.95,0:36:33.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sana gelirsek Queen...Dialogue: 50,0:36:34.12,0:36:39.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yıl oldu kıramadın şu bebenin iradesini.Dialogue: 50,0:36:39.80,0:36:41.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beyinsiz!Dialogue: 50,0:36:41.26,0:36:44.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vıkvıklama lan, ko'duğumun sadist sapığı.Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.95,0:01:45.00,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,BoşlukDialogue: 1,0:01:41.95,0:01:45.00,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,BoşlukDialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:17.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 1,0:02:17.40,0:02:17.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 0,0:02:17.44,0:02:17.49,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 1,0:02:17.44,0:02:17.49,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:17.53,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 1,0:02:17.49,0:02:17.53,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 0,0:02:17.53,0:02:17.57,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 1,0:02:17.53,0:02:17.57,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 0,0:02:17.57,0:02:17.61,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 1,0:02:17.57,0:02:17.61,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 0,0:02:17.61,0:02:17.65,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 1,0:02:17.61,0:02:17.65,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 0,0:02:17.65,0:02:17.70,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 1,0:02:17.65,0:02:17.70,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 0,0:02:17.70,0:02:17.74,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 1,0:02:17.70,0:02:17.74,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 0,0:02:17.74,0:02:17.78,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 1,0:02:17.74,0:02:17.78,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 0,0:02:17.78,0:02:17.82,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 1,0:02:17.78,0:02:17.82,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 0,0:02:17.82,0:02:17.86,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 1,0:02:17.82,0:02:17.86,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 0,0:02:17.86,0:02:17.90,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 1,0:02:17.86,0:02:17.90,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 0,0:02:17.90,0:02:17.95,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 1,0:02:17.90,0:02:17.95,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 0,0:02:17.95,0:02:17.99,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 1,0:02:17.95,0:02:17.99,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 0,0:02:17.99,0:02:18.03,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ShichibukaiDialogue: 1,0:0